<view class="page theme-{{naviTheme}} materials-page">
  <view class="top-title">参考资料</view>
  <view class="materials-sub">共 {{total}} 份。下载后可在微信中预览或转发到其他应用。</view>

  <view class="material-notice panel">
    <view class="notice-mark">!</view>
    <view>历史资料仅供复习参考，法规、编制与时事内容请以当前课程资料和教师要求为准。</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="title" wx:for-item="group">
    <view class="group-title">{{group.title}}<text>{{group.items.length}} 份</text></view>
    <view class="materials-list panel">
      <view wx:for="{{group.items}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="material" class="material-row">
        <view class="file-mark"><view></view></view>
        <view class="material-copy">
          <view class="material-name">{{material.name}}</view>
          <view class="material-note">{{material.note}}</view>
          <view class="material-meta">{{material.period}} · {{material.roleText}} · {{material.typeText}} · {{material.sizeText}}</view>
        </view>
        <button class="download-btn" data-id="{{material.id}}" bindtap="downloadMaterial" loading="{{downloadingId===material.id}}" disabled="{{downloadingId}}">
          <view class="download-mark"></view>
          <text>下载</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
